{#-
    Static Traefik v3 configuration.
    Fully declarative: the whole file is a dump of the traefik_static_config
    dictionary rendered via the to_nice_yaml(indent=2) filter, so overrides
    from inventory/group_vars behave predictably (dict replace semantics).

    NOTE: no `ansible_managed` here on purpose. The managed-by banner embeds
    the control-node date, which would make this file "change" on every run
    and trigger a needless validated restart of the proxy. The header is
    static text, so idempotence holds.
-#}
# Ansible-managed file — do not edit on the host; set traefik_static_config instead.
# Generated from the "traefik_static_config" dictionary.
{{ traefik_static_config | to_nice_yaml(indent=2) }}
